template top-level
   0  MakeClosure k0   ; #<template parity>
   1  GlobalDefine k1  ; parity
   2  Return
template parity  arity 1
   0  Undefined
   1  Undefined
   2  LocalRef 2       ; odd?
   3  MakeClosure k0   ; #<template even?>
   4  LocalSet 1       ; even?
   5  LocalRef 1       ; even?
   6  MakeClosure k1   ; #<template odd?>
   7  LocalSet 2       ; odd?
   8  PatchFree 1 0 2  ; even?.0 = odd?
   9  LocalRef 1       ; even?
  10  LocalRef 0       ; n
  11  TailCall 1
template even?  arity 1  free 1
   0  LocalRef 0       ; n
   1  Fixnum 0
   2  JumpIfNot NumEq →5
   3  True
   4  Return
   5  FreeRef 0        ; odd?
   6  LocalRef 0       ; n
   7  Fixnum 1
   8  Sub
   9  TailCall 1
template odd?  arity 1  free 1
   0  LocalRef 0       ; n
   1  Fixnum 0
   2  JumpIfNot NumEq →5
   3  False
   4  Return
   5  FreeRef 0        ; even?
   6  LocalRef 0       ; n
   7  Fixnum 1
   8  Sub
   9  TailCall 1
template top-level
   0  MakeClosure k0   ; #<template count-to>
   1  GlobalDefine k1  ; count-to
   2  Return
template count-to  arity 1
   0  Undefined
   1  LocalRef 0       ; n
   2  LocalRef 1       ; loop
   3  MakeClosure k0   ; #<template loop>
   4  LocalSet 1       ; loop
   5  PatchFree 1 1 1  ; loop.1 = loop
   6  LocalRef 1       ; loop
   7  Slide 1
   8  Fixnum 0
   9  TailCall 1
template loop  arity 1  free 2
   0  LocalRef 0       ; i
   1  FreeRef 0        ; n
   2  JumpIfNot NumEq →5
   3  LocalRef 0       ; i
   4  Return
   5  LocalRef 0       ; i
   6  Fixnum 1
   7  Add
   8  SelfTailCall 1
